    skos:altLabel "dActor" ;
    rdfs:comment "Represents an entity (such as a person, system, or organization) that interacts with the system to achieve a specific goal. An actor typically performs actions within business Use cases and can be internal (e.g., employees) or external (e.g., customers or partner organizations), active and passive." ;
