    skos:altLabel "dPhysicalService" ;
    rdfs:comment "a technical implementation of a service that runs on physical or virtual infrastructure, providing specific functionalities, usually in the form of software applications, middleware, databases, or platforms. It is concerned with the deployment, operation, and management of the technology stack, ensuring that the service is available, performant, and reliable. Examples include web servers, APIs, databases, and network services." ;
